Z||000012||1FST2M6||06-30-2000||12:37 PM||||just make sure you tell them that another Dynojet shop sent you over there. Engineered Performance in atlanta... Glad you were able to find somthing close... a simple exhaust gas analyzer and a couple quick runs will tell you if you really have any fuel issues. and save you moeny... ||||reg||1
